            This is only my third tab here, and yet another David Nail song. It's an awesome
new tune that's fun and easy to play. You can also sing it just as well with a

Capo on the 1st, but I capo the 2. I like to also keep the ring and pinky finger
of the 3rd fret B and high E string for the Em and D chords. It keeps it all in
one key. But it's the same pattern for the whole song except for the lead in to
Chorus. If you listen to the song you'll know the rhythm. It's very simple, but if
there're any questions just comment :)

